+    `plaintext`, `hidden_input`, `hidden_plane`, `plane_values`,
+    `mask_coefficient`, `unopened`, `ZkRng`, `seed`, `secret`) occurs in
+    `run.json` before its `not_in_a_capture` member, or in a stage file.
